  "notes": "total_registered uses TOTAL (All) registered voters per locality = active + inactive + overseas/military as reported in the 'All Voters' column; statewide total 6,419,107 (active 5,995,313; inactive 423,794). Sum of all 133 locality totals exactly equals the statewide total (verified). Virginia does not register voters by party, so all by_party fields are null. Virginia's 133 localities = 95 counties + 38 independent cities; independent cities have distinct FIPS from like-named counties (e.g., Richmond City 51760 vs Richmond County 51159; Fairfax City 51600 vs Fairfax County 51059; Franklin City 51620 vs Franklin County 51067; Roanoke City 51770 vs Roanoke County 51161). Bedford reverted to a county (no Bedford City). FIPS 51515 (Bedford City) and 51780 (South Boston) are not present as they no longer exist as independent cities."
